{
	"SchemaName": "LIMSMaster",
	"SheetName": "LIMS Data",
	"HeaderRow": 1,
	"//": [
		"CoreBio LIMS sheet ('LIMS Data' in the sample; the importer picks the sheet by header match).",
		"SQL column names follow WellHealth_LIMS_Schema.json / AnalyzePathology_LIMS_Schema.json where the",
		"field is the same. 'Req #' (RCBL...) is the accession: it equals the billing 'Claim Reference #'.",
		"'RID' is the numeric requisition id (Req # = 'RCBL' + RID), 'Order #' the order number.",
		"The sheet spells 'New Status ' with a trailing space; the importer normalizes headers.",
		"DOB and Due Date arrive as text prefixed with a zero-width space; the importer strips it before",
		"converting to DATE. Unmapped columns (icons, Address, ...) go to AdditionalFields."
	],
	"Columns": [
		{ "ExcelColName": "Req #", "Required": true, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "Accession" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "RID", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "Requisition" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Order #", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "OrderID" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "T/F", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "TrueFalse" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Dept", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "Department" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Patient Name", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "PatientFullName" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "DOB", "Required": false, "DataType": "date", "SQLColName": "PatientDateOfBirth" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Icd Codes", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "ICD10Codes" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Site", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "Facility" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Client", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "ClinicName" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Ordering Physician", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "DoctorFullName" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Provider NPI", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "DoctorNPI" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Due Date", "Required": false, "DataType": "date", "SQLColName": "DueDate" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Date Accessioned", "Required": false, "DataType": "date", "SQLColName": "ReqReceivedDate" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Created From", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "CreatedFrom" },
		{ "ExcelColName": "Accessioned by", "Required": false, "DataType": "string", "SQLColName": "AccessionedBy" },
